Setting up an alarm that will send push notifications can be done with the help of push notification services and alarm libraries. Here are the general steps to set it up:

1. Choose a push notification service, like Apple Push Notification Service (APNS), Google Cloud Messaging (GCM), or other push notification providers.

2. Install and set up the chosen notification service on your development environment. This process can be different for different services, but most of them provide guides and documentation to help with the setup.

