5. Send a push notification to a user to set up an alarm and trigger a specific task. This can be done through the push notification service's dashboard or with an API call.

6. When the alarm is triggered, the push notification will be sent to the user's device, and they will be alerted by the app to complete the task.

Please note that the process can vary based on the push notification service and alarm library used.

